  "details": "Description\n\nThe camera view experiences noticeable jitter whenever I look or turn diagonally. This issue occurs consistently across every world I have tested, including the main VRChat world. Reinstalling VRChat did not resolve the problem.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nEnter any VRChat world, then look or turn diagonally. The jitter consistently occurs in every world I enter, including the main VRChat world. I also tried uninstalling and reinstalling VRChat, but the issue remains.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2p2-1903-5de5614b49-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-15_16-00-42.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_62170e88-0abe-41b1-967a-fd41574575cb/1/file)",
